<title>USA: Pioneer Cos unit sells $200 mln 144A notes.</title>
<headline>Pioneer Cos unit sells $200 mln 144A notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144A private placement issue from Pioneer Americas Acquisition Corp was priced on Wednesday via Donaldson, Lufkin and Jenrette, according to market sources.</p>
<p>Pioneer Americas Acquisition Corp is a wholly-owned unit of Pioneer Cos.</p>
<p>Pioneer Cos is a Houston-based manufacturer and</p>
<p>distributor of specialty chemicals.</p>
<p>BORROWER PIONEER AMERICAS ACQUISITION CORP</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	   COUPON 9.25 PCT    MATURITY 6/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SEC NOTES   ISS PRICE 100.00   FIRST PAY DATE 12/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B1	YIELD 9.25 PCT     PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>S&amp;P B-PLUS	     SPREAD 271 BPS     CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
